(5960270, 870539, 60173, '<td valign="top">It''s not something I''m going to buy and put on my wall, but it''s definitely a shot worth cherishing. Remember those photos we see of our parents or grandparents? There''s something very modern classic about it. Something nostalgic. <br/> <br/>I would imagine it has something to do with the beautiful girl''s eyes and her doll. Some would say that the lighting could be improved, but the longer I look at the photo the less those technical lighting issues are recognizable. The DOF and composition frames and leads you straight to her gaze.</td>', 'It''s not something I''m going to buy and put on my wall, but it''s definitely a shot worth cherishing. Remember those photos we see of our parents or grandparents? There''s something very modern classic about it. Something nostalgic.  I would imagine it has something to do with the beautiful girl''s eyes and her doll. Some would say that the lighting could be improved, but the longer I look at the photo the less those technical lighting issues are recognizable. The DOF and composition frames and leads you straight to her gaze.', '2010-04-21 05:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
