(5961419, 871047, 7504, '<td valign="top">I like the skin tones here, although her face is a little washed out. A few little spots in the lower left hand corner.</td>', 'I like the skin tones here, although her face is a little washed out. A few little spots in the lower left hand corner.', '2010-04-21 13:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
