(5961620, 870587, 29293, '<td valign="top">nice separation between subject and background</td>', 'nice separation between subject and background', '2010-04-21 14:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961657, 871157, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very soft and good clothing choice. I think it could have been a bit brighter/livelier.</td>', 'Very soft and good clothing choice. I think it could have been a bit brighter/livelier.', '2010-04-21 15:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961658, 871187, 114225, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind the outdoor shot at all, but the very blown out highlights are distracting, especially in the hat.</td>', 'I don''t mind the outdoor shot at all, but the very blown out highlights are distracting, especially in the hat.', '2010-04-21 15:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961660, 871603, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good choice for pose. I''m surprised she isn''t wearing a necklace, as a nice one may have enhanced the pose a bit further.</td>', 'Good choice for pose. I''m surprised she isn''t wearing a necklace, as a nice one may have enhanced the pose a bit further.', '2010-04-21 15:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961663, 871513, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose choice. It feels like he doesn''t want to be there. Maybe a bit more action or some props to say why his shirt is off.</td>', 'Interesting pose choice. It feels like he doesn''t want to be there. Maybe a bit more action or some props to say why his shirt is off.', '2010-04-21 15:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961664, 870195, 114225, '<td valign="top">Haha, love the relative size of the guitar. I''m a bit concerned by his ability to float in mid air!</td>', 'Haha, love the relative size of the guitar. I''m a bit concerned by his ability to float in mid air!', '2010-04-21 15:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961667, 871364, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good lighting. For the shoes, my wife always tells me that having the pants behind the tongue of the shoe looks a little dorky. Maybe she should pull the pants over the tongue.</td>', 'Good lighting. For the shoes, my wife always tells me that having the pants behind the tongue of the shoe looks a little dorky. Maybe she should pull the pants over the tongue.', '2010-04-21 15:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961671, 870865, 114225, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice of pose/props. The expression on her face says "are we done yet?" This is someone good, as biker girls should be bad-ass. But unfortunately, I think it falls less under the bad-ass and more under boredom.</td>', 'Excellent choice of pose/props. The expression on her face says "are we done yet?" This is someone good, as biker girls should be bad-ass. But unfortunately, I think it falls less under the bad-ass and more under boredom.', '2010-04-21 15:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961673, 871585, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good choice of clothing for the model. It a good mix of hip and mom. I''m not sure how I feel about her leaning ahead.</td>', 'Good choice of clothing for the model. It a good mix of hip and mom. I''m not sure how I feel about her leaning ahead.', '2010-04-21 15:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961674, 869992, 114225, '<td valign="top">Oooh, this one really tells a story, and leaves us wondering who she is talking to. My only suggestion would be her eyes, they seem a bit distant.</td>', 'Oooh, this one really tells a story, and leaves us wondering who she is talking to. My only suggestion would be her eyes, they seem a bit distant.', '2010-04-21 15:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961676, 870347, 114225, '<td valign="top">vEry cool shot. I could see this being used for a portfolio for victoria''s secret.</td>', 'vEry cool shot. I could see this being used for a portfolio for victoria''s secret.', '2010-04-21 15:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961680, 871172, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting (the face lighting really draws you in), and the coordinated "outfit." I wonder if it would have been fetter if she were looking at the camera.</td>', 'I like the lighting (the face lighting really draws you in), and the coordinated "outfit." I wonder if it would have been fetter if she were looking at the camera.', '2010-04-21 15:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961681, 871311, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good use of posing and props. Is she a firefighter? :)<br/>The clothing really fits her style.</td>', 'Good use of posing and props. Is she a firefighter? :)The clothing really fits her style.', '2010-04-21 15:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961684, 870701, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good choice of props for this model. The only suggestions I would have is straighten out the cloth on the floor so it''s invisible.</td>', 'Good choice of props for this model. The only suggestions I would have is straighten out the cloth on the floor so it''s invisible.', '2010-04-21 15:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961687, 871008, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice and basic. However, his arms crossed in front of him says "I''m not sure about this."</td>', 'Nice and basic. However, his arms crossed in front of him says "I''m not sure about this."', '2010-04-21 15:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961688, 871305, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good setting and good clothing choice for him, that really seems to fit his style. I don''t really like when pants are worn too low, but that didn''t make me vote down any.</td>', 'Good setting and good clothing choice for him, that really seems to fit his style. I don''t really like when pants are worn too low, but that didn''t make me vote down any.', '2010-04-21 15:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961690, 870734, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great "rocker" photo. Looks like he is ready to go onstage. I wonder if some stage props could have enhanced it further.</td>', 'Great "rocker" photo. Looks like he is ready to go onstage. I wonder if some stage props could have enhanced it further.', '2010-04-21 15:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961692, 871237, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very unique style. I like it, but it seems to be hiding the real person. Less bulky clothing may help that.</td>', 'Very unique style. I like it, but it seems to be hiding the real person. Less bulky clothing may help that.', '2010-04-21 15:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961693, 871071, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I feel the legs should be just as sharp as the torso.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I feel the legs should be just as sharp as the torso.', '2010-04-21 15:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961694, 871048, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very good classic pose. The lighting is also done very well.</td>', 'Very good classic pose. The lighting is also done very well.', '2010-04-21 15:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961696, 871604, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good choice of model/ clothing, and pose. However, the guys on ladders are a bit distracting, especially the one on the right.</td>', 'Good choice of model/ clothing, and pose. However, the guys on ladders are a bit distracting, especially the one on the right.', '2010-04-21 15:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961699, 871334, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very creative. I really like how she is reading the comics section. I don''t know that she would use it for a portfolio, but cool nonetheless.</td>', 'Very creative. I really like how she is reading the comics section. I don''t know that she would use it for a portfolio, but cool nonetheless.', '2010-04-21 15:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961703, 870586, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great facial expression for this photo. also, the perspective is cool, but I don''t know that it falls into "full-length."</td>', 'Great facial expression for this photo. also, the perspective is cool, but I don''t know that it falls into "full-length."', '2010-04-21 15:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961705, 870904, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a really great photo. Something I would expect to see in a magazine.</td>', 'This is a really great photo. Something I would expect to see in a magazine.', '2010-04-21 15:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961707, 870347, 96530, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. One nitpick for me is the garment just barely interacting with the frame on the left. Still a good shot :-)</td>', 'Very nicely done. One nitpick for me is the garment just barely interacting with the frame on the left. Still a good shot :-)', '2010-04-21 15:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961708, 871073, 114225, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I see where you were going on this one. I think the most distracting element to me is the very hard shadows, especially on the face.</td>', 'Hmmm, I see where you were going on this one. I think the most distracting element to me is the very hard shadows, especially on the face.', '2010-04-21 15:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961711, 870270, 114225, '<td valign="top">Well done. I like the setup and pose of the model. Would definitely be used in a portfolio.</td>', 'Well done. I like the setup and pose of the model. Would definitely be used in a portfolio.', '2010-04-21 15:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961714, 870848, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and use of the "above the glasses" look.</td>', 'Great lighting and use of the "above the glasses" look.', '2010-04-21 15:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961723, 867809, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this photo overall, but wonder if could be even better closer up. Also, maybe use a wider aperture so the background isn''t as distracting.</td>', 'I like this photo overall, but wonder if could be even better closer up. Also, maybe use a wider aperture so the background isn''t as distracting.', '2010-04-21 15:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961724, 871568, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. I could see it in a portfolio for sure.</td>', 'Very nicely done. I could see it in a portfolio for sure.', '2010-04-21 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961726, 870587, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great choices on lighting clothing, and pose. That style seems to really fit her.</td>', 'Great choices on lighting clothing, and pose. That style seems to really fit her.', '2010-04-21 15:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5961732, 869693, 96530, '<td valign="top">A good shot, but the sharpest focus seems to be on her right shoulder rather than her face and there is maybe a little too much focus on the surroundings- they compete with your model.</td>', 'A good shot, but the sharpest focus seems to be on her right shoulder rather than her face and there is maybe a little too much focus on the surroundings- they compete with your model.', '2010-04-21 15:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
