(5962547, 871181, 116674, '<td valign="top">awesome shot!!</td>', 'awesome shot!!', '2010-04-21 21:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962548, 870347, 116674, '<td valign="top">WOW Nicely done!! initially rated nine, went back and gave it a ten. It deserves the blue!!</td>', 'WOW Nicely done!! initially rated nine, went back and gave it a ten. It deserves the blue!!', '2010-04-21 21:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962564, 870586, 65468, '<td valign="top">This had a lot of potential but I voted it low because I don''t think it meets the full length requirement of the challenge.  Great angle, color etc but not full length.  The young man did an excellent job of modeling.</td>', 'This had a lot of potential but I voted it low because I don''t think it meets the full length requirement of the challenge.  Great angle, color etc but not full length.  The young man did an excellent job of modeling.', '2010-04-21 21:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962584, 867809, 65468, '<td valign="top">Would have been great if the hem of the dress was straightened and I think if she turned the left shoulder a little more the round shadow would have been eliminated.</td>', 'Would have been great if the hem of the dress was straightened and I think if she turned the left shoulder a little more the round shadow would have been eliminated.', '2010-04-21 22:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962625, 870865, 112013, '<td valign="top">Very nice set up.  Don''t like that part of the front tire is missing. Makes it a bit to tight of a crop but its still one of my top choices.</td>', 'Very nice set up.  Don''t like that part of the front tire is missing. Makes it a bit to tight of a crop but its still one of my top choices.', '2010-04-21 22:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962628, 871233, 112013, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I would have cropped more off the bottom but its one of my top choices.</td>', 'Very cool. I would have cropped more off the bottom but its one of my top choices.', '2010-04-21 22:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962630, 870270, 112013, '<td valign="top">A tiny bit out of focus and a bit blown on the hand but its a nice set up. 7</td>', 'A tiny bit out of focus and a bit blown on the hand but its a nice set up. 7', '2010-04-21 22:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962631, 871595, 112013, '<td valign="top">Nice. Lots of personality.  The only thing I don''t like is the crinkles in the blanket but gave it a 7.</td>', 'Nice. Lots of personality.  The only thing I don''t like is the crinkles in the blanket but gave it a 7.', '2010-04-21 22:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962632, 871528, 112013, '<td valign="top">She is a bit to stoic looking in the face but I still gave it a 7.</td>', 'She is a bit to stoic looking in the face but I still gave it a 7.', '2010-04-21 22:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962633, 870748, 112013, '<td valign="top">Not liking the background color. Wish it was on white or even black but I do like the outfit and the intensity in her eyes. 7</td>', 'Not liking the background color. Wish it was on white or even black but I do like the outfit and the intensity in her eyes. 7', '2010-04-21 22:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962635, 870347, 112013, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but not really liking the outfit.  Something more flowing and less wrinkled would have been better and all in white without the underwear.  I gave it a 7 though.</td>', 'I like the idea but not really liking the outfit.  Something more flowing and less wrinkled would have been better and all in white without the underwear.  I gave it a 7 though.', '2010-04-21 22:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962637, 870904, 112013, '<td valign="top">Nice outfit and pose. I would have liked to see more connection with the camera from her though and not her looking away.  I gave it a 7</td>', 'Nice outfit and pose. I would have liked to see more connection with the camera from her though and not her looking away.  I gave it a 7', '2010-04-21 22:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962639, 869612, 112013, '<td valign="top">Great face and personality. Not liking her bottom half blending in with the background though. The contrast of having her legs and feet showing would have given the shot more balance I think. I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Great face and personality. Not liking her bottom half blending in with the background though. The contrast of having her legs and feet showing would have given the shot more balance I think. I gave it a 7.', '2010-04-21 22:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962640, 871252, 112013, '<td valign="top">Nice but kind of ordinary.  It''s a shot I feel I have seen many times before, and her make up is a bit to intense.  I gave it a 7 though.</td>', 'Nice but kind of ordinary.  It''s a shot I feel I have seen many times before, and her make up is a bit to intense.  I gave it a 7 though.', '2010-04-21 22:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962641, 870734, 112013, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast of the black on black, but his facial expression makes him look frustrated, like he is waiting for a bus that is late. I gave it a 6.</td>', 'I love the contrast of the black on black, but his facial expression makes him look frustrated, like he is waiting for a bus that is late. I gave it a 6.', '2010-04-21 22:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962642, 870848, 112013, '<td valign="top">The shoes don''t go with the outfit and glasses are a no no for a model shot. She also lost her neck by looking down which makes her look very short with the long gown on.  I gave it a 6 though.</td>', 'The shoes don''t go with the outfit and glasses are a no no for a model shot. She also lost her neck by looking down which makes her look very short with the long gown on.  I gave it a 6 though.', '2010-04-21 22:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962643, 871543, 112013, '<td valign="top">Good focus but to me its boring. There is no real personality showing in the face. The way he is standing also makes his right arm look awkward.  I gave it a 6 though.</td>', 'Good focus but to me its boring. There is no real personality showing in the face. The way he is standing also makes his right arm look awkward.  I gave it a 6 though.', '2010-04-21 22:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962644, 870868, 112013, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus for me.  I also don''t like the heel sticking in the fabric and the belt end being under her hand. It distracts.  This kind of pose also makes her lose her waist which is giving the illusion that her head and chest is bigger then the rest of her body.  I gave it a 6 though.</td>', 'A little out of focus for me.  I also don''t like the heel sticking in the fabric and the belt end being under her hand. It distracts.  This kind of pose also makes her lose her waist which is giving the illusion that her head and chest is bigger then the rest of her body.  I gave it a 6 though.', '2010-04-21 22:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962645, 870586, 112013, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and the personality. 6</td>', 'I like the perspective and the personality. 6', '2010-04-21 22:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962646, 871568, 112013, '<td valign="top">Very catalog but not liking the green tie. If it was blue it would have had better contrast. 6</td>', 'Very catalog but not liking the green tie. If it was blue it would have had better contrast. 6', '2010-04-21 22:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962647, 870701, 112013, '<td valign="top">The only thing this is missing is a smile. His expression is to intense for the pose.  I really don''t like the white blanket all crinkled on the bottom either. Makes the whole shot seem to contrived and a bit out of place. It needed more props I think. I gave it a 6.</td>', 'The only thing this is missing is a smile. His expression is to intense for the pose.  I really don''t like the white blanket all crinkled on the bottom either. Makes the whole shot seem to contrived and a bit out of place. It needed more props I think. I gave it a 6.', '2010-04-21 22:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962649, 871378, 112013, '<td valign="top">Nice but a bit boring to me. If I was a modeling agency representative I don''t think this photo would tell me much other then this is what the guy looks like.  It''s not really a shot that is giving me any inspiration of what I could use him for. I gave it a 6 though.</td>', 'Nice but a bit boring to me. If I was a modeling agency representative I don''t think this photo would tell me much other then this is what the guy looks like.  It''s not really a shot that is giving me any inspiration of what I could use him for. I gave it a 6 though.', '2010-04-21 22:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962650, 871585, 112013, '<td valign="top">Nice. A bit too much yellow in tones that drifted into the background to the right of the shot and the the bottom around her legs, but she is giving a lot of personality. 6</td>', 'Nice. A bit too much yellow in tones that drifted into the background to the right of the shot and the the bottom around her legs, but she is giving a lot of personality. 6', '2010-04-21 22:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962651, 871008, 112013, '<td valign="top">A bit to cropped out on the left and I am not really liking his pose.  It doesn''t really give me an idea of his body proportions and what I could really use him for if I was a modeling agency representative.  It''s also just a bit to bright around the one side of the face and not enough on the other.  I gave it a 6 though.</td>', 'A bit to cropped out on the left and I am not really liking his pose.  It doesn''t really give me an idea of his body proportions and what I could really use him for if I was a modeling agency representative.  It''s also just a bit to bright around the one side of the face and not enough on the other.  I gave it a 6 though.', '2010-04-21 22:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962653, 871603, 112013, '<td valign="top">I like the facial expression.  Not really liking the outfit or the pose but its still nice at a 6.</td>', 'I like the facial expression.  Not really liking the outfit or the pose but its still nice at a 6.', '2010-04-21 22:29:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5962654, 870986, 112013, '<td valign="top">I like the white background on this.  The hair is just a bit to plain Jane for me but I gave it a 6 overall.</td>', 'I like the white background on this.  The hair is just a bit to plain Jane for me but I gave it a 6 overall.', '2010-04-21 22:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962655, 871188, 112013, '<td valign="top">Not really liking the color of the dress on this and that she is hunched over but it''s nice for a 6.</td>', 'Not really liking the color of the dress on this and that she is hunched over but it''s nice for a 6.', '2010-04-21 22:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962657, 871249, 112013, '<td valign="top">This photo is showing a lot of edge but its not in her facial expression. The eyes needed to show much more intensity to pull off the outfit. I like the idea of the boots to but not really on the black background. I gave it a 6 though.</td>', 'This photo is showing a lot of edge but its not in her facial expression. The eyes needed to show much more intensity to pull off the outfit. I like the idea of the boots to but not really on the black background. I gave it a 6 though.', '2010-04-21 22:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962658, 869266, 112013, '<td valign="top">This is showing a lot of personality but the pose makes her lose her neck giving the illusion of a head on a pair of shoulders.  It takes away from her overall body proportions, especially in a side pose. Still a good 6 though.</td>', 'This is showing a lot of personality but the pose makes her lose her neck giving the illusion of a head on a pair of shoulders.  It takes away from her overall body proportions, especially in a side pose. Still a good 6 though.', '2010-04-21 22:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962661, 870228, 112013, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 6 but the dress is what is distracting to me in this shot. Had it been in black and not so busy it wouldn''t be competing with the stars and it would have had me focus more on her personality.  I also would have liked to see her eyes.  Nice for a 6 though.</td>', 'I gave it a 6 but the dress is what is distracting to me in this shot. Had it been in black and not so busy it wouldn''t be competing with the stars and it would have had me focus more on her personality.  I also would have liked to see her eyes.  Nice for a 6 though.', '2010-04-21 22:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962662, 871112, 112013, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and expression. 6</td>', 'Nice pose and expression. 6', '2010-04-21 22:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962664, 871369, 57965, '<td valign="top">I wish her face were just a bit more clearer/sharper/less blurry. Would have liked if her foot weren''t amputated either.  Nonetheless, wonderful tone, colour and lighting.</td>', 'I wish her face were just a bit more clearer/sharper/less blurry. Would have liked if her foot weren''t amputated either.  Nonetheless, wonderful tone, colour and lighting.', '2010-04-21 22:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962668, 871477, 112013, '<td valign="top">Very Betty Boop meets Chinese Street Fashion. She also looks air born and if she is then she did a good job of keeping her face controlled but that right shoulder is to far up, making her lose her neck, making her look shorter then she is.  Still nice for a 6 though.</td>', 'Very Betty Boop meets Chinese Street Fashion. She also looks air born and if she is then she did a good job of keeping her face controlled but that right shoulder is to far up, making her lose her neck, making her look shorter then she is.  Still nice for a 6 though.', '2010-04-21 22:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962671, 871011, 112013, '<td valign="top">Cute but a bit boring to me in the way she is standing.  Nice personality though and good for a 6.</td>', 'Cute but a bit boring to me in the way she is standing.  Nice personality though and good for a 6.', '2010-04-21 22:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962673, 869992, 112013, '<td valign="top">I like it but that pole makes the shot look tilted when it''s not. The shadow is another distraction and I would have liked to see her more engaged with the photographer.  I gave it a 6 though.</td>', 'I like it but that pole makes the shot look tilted when it''s not. The shadow is another distraction and I would have liked to see her more engaged with the photographer.  I gave it a 6 though.', '2010-04-21 22:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962677, 871311, 112013, '<td valign="top">Not quite liking the mix of contemporary background with the older dress style and her face is a bit out of focus, but nice enough for a 6.</td>', 'Not quite liking the mix of contemporary background with the older dress style and her face is a bit out of focus, but nice enough for a 6.', '2010-04-21 22:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962678, 871584, 112013, '<td valign="top">Nice but a bit to ordinary of a pose for me. I still gave it a 6.</td>', 'Nice but a bit to ordinary of a pose for me. I still gave it a 6.', '2010-04-21 22:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962681, 870587, 112013, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I would have liked to see a more edgy facial expression to go with the dominatrix look. If you cover her body and just look at her face and hair it looks like she is selling hair shampoo and conditioner. It just doesn''t go with the outfit. Still nice enough for a 6 though.</td>', 'Nice, but I would have liked to see a more edgy facial expression to go with the dominatrix look. If you cover her body and just look at her face and hair it looks like she is selling hair shampoo and conditioner. It just doesn''t go with the outfit. Still nice enough for a 6 though.', '2010-04-21 22:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962682, 871494, 112013, '<td valign="top">I like that you thought out of the box.  Not just someone standing there smiling into the camera.  My drawbacks are the left leg being so far back, and truly not liking the overall outfit, but still nice enough for a 6.</td>', 'I like that you thought out of the box.  Not just someone standing there smiling into the camera.  My drawbacks are the left leg being so far back, and truly not liking the overall outfit, but still nice enough for a 6.', '2010-04-21 22:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962684, 871298, 112013, '<td valign="top">Oh. Those shoes. Those shoes. Those shoes. They look matronly and just don''t go with the shot. I still gave it a 6.</td>', 'Oh. Those shoes. Those shoes. Those shoes. They look matronly and just don''t go with the shot. I still gave it a 6.', '2010-04-21 22:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962686, 868020, 112013, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but the eyes are a very important part of a modeling shot. She just looks a little to bored. 6</td>', 'Beautiful, but the eyes are a very important part of a modeling shot. She just looks a little to bored. 6', '2010-04-21 22:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962688, 870574, 112013, '<td valign="top">It''s cute but a bit of a contrived and ordinary pose. It''s a 6 for me.</td>', 'It''s cute but a bit of a contrived and ordinary pose. It''s a 6 for me.', '2010-04-21 22:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962689, 869615, 112013, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this looks like a bad prom picture to me.  To many shadows and it looks like she was caught off guard and the photographer snapped the shot just when something caught her eye above. I gave it a 5.</td>', 'Unfortunately this looks like a bad prom picture to me.  To many shadows and it looks like she was caught off guard and the photographer snapped the shot just when something caught her eye above. I gave it a 5.', '2010-04-21 22:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962690, 871557, 112013, '<td valign="top">Cute but the smile is forced and the hair needed a bit more grooming. Its just not really doing much for me either way. 5</td>', 'Cute but the smile is forced and the hair needed a bit more grooming. Its just not really doing much for me either way. 5', '2010-04-21 22:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962692, 871172, 112013, '<td valign="top">Instead of looking editorial it kind of looks more like she is in pain. It just doesn''t all go together cohesively.  Facial expression is bored, body pose is awkward. I gave it a 5.</td>', 'Instead of looking editorial it kind of looks more like she is in pain. It just doesn''t all go together cohesively.  Facial expression is bored, body pose is awkward. I gave it a 5.', '2010-04-21 22:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962694, 871579, 112013, '<td valign="top">Its a bit to bright for me and those glasses are blocking her eyes which blocks the expression in them.  I gave it a 5 for personality though.</td>', 'Its a bit to bright for me and those glasses are blocking her eyes which blocks the expression in them.  I gave it a 5 for personality though.', '2010-04-21 22:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962696, 870225, 112013, '<td valign="top">Not really liking the pose with the hand to the face and its a bit to dark overall. 5</td>', 'Not really liking the pose with the hand to the face and its a bit to dark overall. 5', '2010-04-21 22:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962697, 871531, 112013, '<td valign="top">That blouse doesnt work well here and her hand and arm are not in a good position. The position of the arm makes her look bigger in the waist and the hand looks large. 5</td>', 'That blouse doesnt work well here and her hand and arm are not in a good position. The position of the arm makes her look bigger in the waist and the hand looks large. 5', '2010-04-21 22:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962698, 869080, 112013, '<td valign="top">This needed some wind in the hair to give a bit of movement to the shot. Her pose is also making her look very short and out of proportion.  Its a bit out of focus to. 5</td>', 'This needed some wind in the hair to give a bit of movement to the shot. Her pose is also making her look very short and out of proportion.  Its a bit out of focus to. 5', '2010-04-21 22:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5962699, 871513, 112013, '<td valign="top">Its a little out of focus and not really doing much for me. 5</td>', 'Its a little out of focus and not really doing much for me. 5', '2010-04-21 22:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
