(5964044, 871112, 68546, '<td valign="top">top 5 for me with this one. I love the depth the lighting on the body and face creates but wish you had a little separation on the hair camera right. Either a hair light or the background light moved slightly to the right would have boosted this to a ten for me - 9</td>', 'top 5 for me with this one. I love the depth the lighting on the body and face creates but wish you had a little separation on the hair camera right. Either a hair light or the background light moved slightly to the right would have boosted this to a ten for me - 9', '2010-04-22 17:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5964052, 870347, 68546, '<td valign="top">My first thought was WOW, but then the washed out hair and skin started to detract from this for me. It''s almost as if you''ve used a fill or shadow highlights in Post Process to boost the brightness in these areas? So much potential but lacking a little bit for me.  Still one of the best in the challenge and a solid 8 in this field</td>', 'My first thought was WOW, but then the washed out hair and skin started to detract from this for me. It''s almost as if you''ve used a fill or shadow highlights in Post Process to boost the brightness in these areas? So much potential but lacking a little bit for me.  Still one of the best in the challenge and a solid 8 in this field', '2010-04-22 17:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5964055, 868020, 68546, '<td valign="top">Really good, top 5 for me. Excellent lighting, pose, and composition. Well done - 9</td>', 'Really good, top 5 for me. Excellent lighting, pose, and composition. Well done - 9', '2010-04-22 17:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5964085, 870826, 65468, '<td valign="top">LOL, but I don''t think I would want it in my portfolio.</td>', 'LOL, but I don''t think I would want it in my portfolio.', '2010-04-22 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5964110, 871603, 65468, '<td valign="top">This was well done and looks great converted. Just a few suggestions since this is for a portfolio.  Clean up the background wrinkles around the model, lower the main  light so the nose shadow does not touch the lip and try to get some separation of the right arm at the jacket, it took me a while to see it, finally get rid of the spots on the right shoulder.</td>', 'This was well done and looks great converted. Just a few suggestions since this is for a portfolio.  Clean up the background wrinkles around the model, lower the main  light so the nose shadow does not touch the lip and try to get some separation of the right arm at the jacket, it took me a while to see it, finally get rid of the spots on the right shoulder.', '2010-04-22 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
