(5964141, 871252, 65468, '<td valign="top">One of the best in this challenge.  I think a hair light would have improved the final image. JMHO-7</td>', 'One of the best in this challenge.  I think a hair light would have improved the final image. JMHO-7', '2010-04-22 18:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5964150, 870868, 2780, '<td valign="top">I don''t like all the blurring around the model, and the "shadows" look awful. Very badly edited. 1<br/> <br/>Edited to add: Sorry, that sounded a bit harsh! While the pose is good and lighting natural, for me the positive aspects of the photo are negated by the major problems, so that is why I have given it a 1.</td>', 'I don''t like all the blurring around the model, and the "shadows" look awful. Very badly edited. 1 Edited to add: Sorry, that sounded a bit harsh! While the pose is good and lighting natural, for me the positive aspects of the photo are negated by the major problems, so that is why I have given it a 1.', '2010-04-22 18:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5964160, 871298, 65468, '<td valign="top">Great lighting but something needs to be done to pop the shoes or change them to a lighter color.   The way  the skirt is draped it looks like it has a lot of static in it.  Would suggest better positioning of the hands. JMHO</td>', 'Great lighting but something needs to be done to pop the shoes or change them to a lighter color.   The way  the skirt is draped it looks like it has a lot of static in it.  Would suggest better positioning of the hands. JMHO', '2010-04-22 18:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5964179, 871368, 65468, '<td valign="top">Great location and lighting would have her turn her head a little more to the camera to better light her left eye and straighten the hair more.  If she would place her hands on her hips or thighs it would add a little better look to the pose.  Very nice effort.</td>', 'Great location and lighting would have her turn her head a little more to the camera to better light her left eye and straighten the hair more.  If she would place her hands on her hips or thighs it would add a little better look to the pose.  Very nice effort.', '2010-04-22 19:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5964183, 871304, 65468, '<td valign="top">All the elements are here for a great image but the lighting is flat and just doesn''t give the level necessary of make this a great image.</td>', 'All the elements are here for a great image but the lighting is flat and just doesn''t give the level necessary of make this a great image.', '2010-04-22 19:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5964284, 871364, 65468, '<td valign="top">Well done lighting, the hair is lit well and the eyes are clear and sharp the clothes are a bit casual for an agency port but this is a challenge.  I would have straightened the T above the letters, assuming I saw it during the shoot. One of the better submissions.</td>', 'Well done lighting, the hair is lit well and the eyes are clear and sharp the clothes are a bit casual for an agency port but this is a challenge.  I would have straightened the T above the letters, assuming I saw it during the shoot. One of the better submissions.', '2010-04-22 20:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5964285, 871172, 35513, '<td valign="top">If the lighting on the torso was carried through all the way to the bottom, this would knock my socks off!!</td>', 'If the lighting on the torso was carried through all the way to the bottom, this would knock my socks off!!', '2010-04-22 20:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5964295, 869042, 65468, '<td valign="top">It''s obvious that for the most part you have a great image here, I would have cropped out the light on the right edge and there is something about the area above the bridge of the nose to the forehead that is darker compared to the rest of his face.  Nice work</td>', 'It''s obvious that for the most part you have a great image here, I would have cropped out the light on the right edge and there is something about the area above the bridge of the nose to the forehead that is darker compared to the rest of his face.  Nice work', '2010-04-22 20:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5964300, 869428, 65468, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell if this is full length or not I suspect not.</td>', 'Can''t tell if this is full length or not I suspect not.', '2010-04-22 20:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5964303, 870748, 65468, '<td valign="top">Well done, I would have liked to see some light reflected on the lower part of the dress to bring up its style other wise a great image.</td>', 'Well done, I would have liked to see some light reflected on the lower part of the dress to bring up its style other wise a great image.', '2010-04-22 20:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
