(5964487, 869693, 33736, '<td valign="top">This is my absolute favorite - totally unique concept. The tones fit the portrayed era.  Although the model is dead center, and surrounded by a lot of stuff, it is the bright colors of the objects on the right side that keep the eyes moving around the image.<br/> <br/>On a personal note - the only thing that is jarring to me is the large tattoo on the model''s arm  I mean, how many elegant (or low class)women had tats back in the 20''s.</td>', 'This is my absolute favorite - totally unique concept. The tones fit the portrayed era.  Although the model is dead center, and surrounded by a lot of stuff, it is the bright colors of the objects on the right side that keep the eyes moving around the image. On a personal note - the only thing that is jarring to me is the large tattoo on the model''s arm  I mean, how many elegant (or low class)women had tats back in the 20''s.', '2010-04-22 23:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5964504, 870004, 33736, '<td valign="top">Bet the title will garner a lot of comments.  Lady in RED?  I liked the way you caught the swirl of the garment, but the grays of the background was a bit flat.  Also, there are some objects immediately above her head that look like an odd hairpiece.  There is a strange strip of color and/or light along the hemline just above her right foot.</td>', 'Bet the title will garner a lot of comments.  Lady in RED?  I liked the way you caught the swirl of the garment, but the grays of the background was a bit flat.  Also, there are some objects immediately above her head that look like an odd hairpiece.  There is a strange strip of color and/or light along the hemline just above her right foot.', '2010-04-22 23:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5964505, 871252, 104841, '<td valign="top">good strong pose here</td>', 'good strong pose here', '2010-04-22 23:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5964509, 870195, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice set up, his shirt is a little bit washed out, maybe some softer light would help, also it would make the left hand side a little bit brighter.</td>', 'nice set up, his shirt is a little bit washed out, maybe some softer light would help, also it would make the left hand side a little bit brighter.', '2010-04-22 23:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
