(5964527, 871368, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice gritty location. don''t forget to try and get right in front of you model to avoid distorting the perspective (where the floor and wall meet is not 100% level). I am not the biggest fan of the pose her left arm just loops limp and weak.</td>', 'nice gritty location. don''t forget to try and get right in front of you model to avoid distorting the perspective (where the floor and wall meet is not 100% level). I am not the biggest fan of the pose her left arm just loops limp and weak.', '2010-04-22 23:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
