(5965254, 871187, 80904, '<td valign="top">youre problably one of those getting dinged for not being in a studio, but pose is cute , I would have chosen a more solid background without distractions. But well done</td>', 'youre problably one of those getting dinged for not being in a studio, but pose is cute , I would have chosen a more solid background without distractions. But well done', '2010-04-23 14:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5965257, 870070, 80904, '<td valign="top">cute baby and I know that baby shots are difficult to do, but I would suggest you always try to have the child look at the camera. It envokes more emotion.</td>', 'cute baby and I know that baby shots are difficult to do, but I would suggest you always try to have the child look at the camera. It envokes more emotion.', '2010-04-23 14:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5965259, 871233, 80904, '<td valign="top">This is quite an unique shot. Cant say it appeals to me, but its different and nonetheless is a good shot. It catches attention.</td>', 'This is quite an unique shot. Cant say it appeals to me, but its different and nonetheless is a good shot. It catches attention.', '2010-04-23 14:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5965260, 871011, 80904, '<td valign="top">cute photo, but she seems a bit imposed against her will lol.</td>', 'cute photo, but she seems a bit imposed against her will lol.', '2010-04-23 14:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5965264, 871514, 80904, '<td valign="top">The girl and pose are good, but here are couple things wrong here:<br/> <br/>The background needs to be light up more (try a flash pointing to the white to blow it out so you dont see any wrinkles). <br/>Also insterad of using a sheet try a seamless white paper. They sell for like 30 bucks at your local camera store and work much better for these types of shots.<br/> <br/>Also, the lighting on her doesnt seem even. Her face is lit up nicely, but the body seems flat. I would suggest a softbox that would lit up the entire body not just the face. And maybe the saddle</td>', 'The girl and pose are good, but here are couple things wrong here: The background needs to be light up more (try a flash pointing to the white to blow it out so you dont see any wrinkles). Also insterad of using a sheet try a seamless white paper. They sell for like 30 bucks at your local camera store and work much better for these types of shots. Also, the lighting on her doesnt seem even. Her face is lit up nicely, but the body seems flat. I would suggest a softbox that would lit up the entire body not just the face. And maybe the saddle', '2010-04-23 14:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5965269, 871304, 80904, '<td valign="top">Pretty girl, nice studio setup, but the light is off quite a bit. In full body shots you need to make sure that the light is even across the entire body not just the face. <br/> <br/>Also shooting a black dress is difficult, so you will need to make sure you had more lights</td>', 'Pretty girl, nice studio setup, but the light is off quite a bit. In full body shots you need to make sure that the light is even across the entire body not just the face.  Also shooting a black dress is difficult, so you will need to make sure you had more lights', '2010-04-23 14:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5965296, 871382, 101702, '<td valign="top">That''s some studio! :-)</td>', 'That''s some studio! :-)', '2010-04-23 14:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5965297, 871362, 101702, '<td valign="top">I nice shot, and I love the vividness of the purple, but to me this DMNC on 2 counts... it''s not (unless I''m mistaken) taken in a studio - nice studio if it is! :-) and it''s not a full length shot. I knocked a mark off for the perceived DNMC. Nonetheless I like the photo overall as far as composition, pose etc.</td>', 'I nice shot, and I love the vividness of the purple, but to me this DMNC on 2 counts... it''s not (unless I''m mistaken) taken in a studio - nice studio if it is! :-) and it''s not a full length shot. I knocked a mark off for the perceived DNMC. Nonetheless I like the photo overall as far as composition, pose etc.', '2010-04-23 14:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5965324, 871047, 101702, '<td valign="top">Lots of marks bottom left which are distracting and should have been cloned out in my opinion, I''ve dropped a mark due to that.</td>', 'Lots of marks bottom left which are distracting and should have been cloned out in my opinion, I''ve dropped a mark due to that.', '2010-04-23 14:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5965325, 871305, 101702, '<td valign="top">Nice studio! :-)</td>', 'Nice studio! :-)', '2010-04-23 14:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5965326, 871514, 101702, '<td valign="top">Seeing the folds/creases in the backdrop is a little distracting and perhaps these could have been addressed under the advanced editing rules. I also feel the balance is off a little... perhaps if she her head was angled to the right facing into the frame more I would have scored it a bit higher.</td>', 'Seeing the folds/creases in the backdrop is a little distracting and perhaps these could have been addressed under the advanced editing rules. I also feel the balance is off a little... perhaps if she her head was angled to the right facing into the frame more I would have scored it a bit higher.', '2010-04-23 14:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5965739, 871073, 116957, '<td valign="top">her stance fits the look, classic</td>', 'her stance fits the look, classic', '2010-04-23 21:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5965846, 869266, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great expression!</td>', 'Great expression!', '2010-04-23 22:27:16.000000', NULL, 1);
