(5965847, 871334, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea!!  One suggestion: I think it would be neat to see this shot using the comics (because of the colors) as the background, with her in the b&amp;w newsprint.  Though I do love how the comics stand out!</td>', 'Very creative idea!!  One suggestion: I think it would be neat to see this shot using the comics (because of the colors) as the background, with her in the b&w newsprint.  Though I do love how the comics stand out!', '2010-04-23 22:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
