(5967054, 870195, 37858, '<td valign="top">Do I see a little bit of Norman Rockwell in this?  I think so.  7</td>', 'Do I see a little bit of Norman Rockwell in this?  I think so.  7', '2010-04-24 21:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967239, 871304, 90414, '<td valign="top">I''m not a portrait photographer by any means, but this needs more light imo. Her face and shoulder are lit, but there is no detail in her hair or dress, and her right arm looks much darker than her left. If working with one light, a homemade reflector (white foamcore or cardboard with aluminum foil) could be used to illuminate the unlit side.</td>', 'I''m not a portrait photographer by any means, but this needs more light imo. Her face and shoulder are lit, but there is no detail in her hair or dress, and her right arm looks much darker than her left. If working with one light, a homemade reflector (white foamcore or cardboard with aluminum foil) could be used to illuminate the unlit side.', '2010-04-25 00:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967366, 870904, 39349, '<td valign="top">Great pose, nice lighting.</td>', 'Great pose, nice lighting.', '2010-04-25 02:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967367, 871604, 39349, '<td valign="top">YES! Best shot I''ve voted on so far. 10 all the way!</td>', 'YES! Best shot I''ve voted on so far. 10 all the way!', '2010-04-25 02:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967373, 871172, 39349, '<td valign="top">Okay first off, beautiful model. Good exposure a little hot on her face and forehead but I''ll leave that to artistic impression. The things here that bother me are her stiff right arm and awkward position of her right leg. It feels as if she''s about to fall over. <br/> <br/>Still I give this shot an 8.</td>', 'Okay first off, beautiful model. Good exposure a little hot on her face and forehead but I''ll leave that to artistic impression. The things here that bother me are her stiff right arm and awkward position of her right leg. It feels as if she''s about to fall over.  Still I give this shot an 8.', '2010-04-25 02:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967395, 871071, 39349, '<td valign="top">Good shot but the borders are not working for me. Also, the attempt at a shallow DOF through Photoshop isn''t the cleanest. I like the choice to go b/w. Good luck.</td>', 'Good shot but the borders are not working for me. Also, the attempt at a shallow DOF through Photoshop isn''t the cleanest. I like the choice to go b/w. Good luck.', '2010-04-25 02:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967396, 871311, 39349, '<td valign="top">Cool retro shot, nice model and attitude makes for a great story. Post work is fantastic. Good luck. :)</td>', 'Cool retro shot, nice model and attitude makes for a great story. Post work is fantastic. Good luck. :)', '2010-04-25 02:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967409, 870225, 39349, '<td valign="top">Love it, lighting is moody and cool. Model is easy on the eyes and the pose invites you in to the story of the girl. My only suggestion would be to not have cropped in so close, but that is a nit pick on my part.</td>', 'Love it, lighting is moody and cool. Model is easy on the eyes and the pose invites you in to the story of the girl. My only suggestion would be to not have cropped in so close, but that is a nit pick on my part.', '2010-04-25 03:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967412, 871579, 39349, '<td valign="top">Great studio shot. Like the model too! ;) Fun expressive pose and great smile.</td>', 'Great studio shot. Like the model too! ;) Fun expressive pose and great smile.', '2010-04-25 03:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967421, 871112, 39349, '<td valign="top">Great model, great lighting and great title. I feel that this shot is begging for the model to be center frame. I don''t like the lopsided feeling the shot has with the current crop. Adjust this and you''ll go from a good portrait to a WOW portrait. IMHO.</td>', 'Great model, great lighting and great title. I feel that this shot is begging for the model to be center frame. I don''t like the lopsided feeling the shot has with the current crop. Adjust this and you''ll go from a good portrait to a WOW portrait. IMHO.', '2010-04-25 03:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967429, 870586, 106910, '<td valign="top">Great perspective</td>', 'Great perspective', '2010-04-25 03:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967430, 871528, 39349, '<td valign="top">Edgy and well shot portrait. High marks from this voter.</td>', 'Edgy and well shot portrait. High marks from this voter.', '2010-04-25 03:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967431, 871430, 106910, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the desat works here</td>', 'I don''t think the desat works here', '2010-04-25 03:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967432, 870539, 39349, '<td valign="top">B/W conversion would serve this shot best IMHO.</td>', 'B/W conversion would serve this shot best IMHO.', '2010-04-25 03:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967434, 871157, 106910, '<td valign="top">She just sinks into the background - definitely needs more lighting to bring out the model.</td>', 'She just sinks into the background - definitely needs more lighting to bring out the model.', '2010-04-25 03:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5967435, 870748, 39349, '<td valign="top">OMG is all have to say! Well done!</td>', 'OMG is all have to say! Well done!', '2010-04-25 03:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
