(5973549, 871528, 96751, '<td valign="top">Provocative and well executed.  Fabulous face.</td>', 'Provocative and well executed.  Fabulous face.', '2010-04-27 03:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973552, 869693, 96751, '<td valign="top">There might just be too much going on in this shot, which is gorgeous.  Love her face, her make-up, her hair, her shoes.  Leaning against the piano might have been enough, with the rest just hinted at in the dark.</td>', 'There might just be too much going on in this shot, which is gorgeous.  Love her face, her make-up, her hair, her shoes.  Leaning against the piano might have been enough, with the rest just hinted at in the dark.', '2010-04-27 03:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973608, 871172, 100402, '<td valign="top">A strange and uncomfortable looking pose. The light and mostly the shadows are in my opinion a bit complex.</td>', 'A strange and uncomfortable looking pose. The light and mostly the shadows are in my opinion a bit complex.', '2010-04-27 04:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973609, 871334, 100402, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I fiend the view point a bit too high. Also a bigger room and a wider lens might improve the shot.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I fiend the view point a bit too high. Also a bigger room and a wider lens might improve the shot.', '2010-04-27 04:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5973801, 871368, 110041, '<td valign="top">Has she dislocated her shoulder?</td>', 'Has she dislocated her shoulder?', '2010-04-27 08:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974492, 871237, 100335, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting, definitely the level of quality i''d see in a top model''s portfolio</td>', 'Excellent lighting, definitely the level of quality i''d see in a top model''s portfolio', '2010-04-27 14:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974758, 870748, 116499, '<td valign="top">I like this shot except for her legs. They''re awkwardly placed and make her body seem wider than it should. The pose is cat-like without the spring. That all said, she connects well with the camera and I like the tension in her left hand. She''s well-styled and you used good light.</td>', 'I like this shot except for her legs. They''re awkwardly placed and make her body seem wider than it should. The pose is cat-like without the spring. That all said, she connects well with the camera and I like the tension in her left hand. She''s well-styled and you used good light.', '2010-04-27 17:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974761, 868282, 116499, '<td valign="top">Love the high-key nature of this image, the blown-out background, the ''framing,'' and his pose. The image might have been stronger if he had been off to the right side of the window frame (with more to look out into) and if the model had extended his neck slightly for more length/tension. Also, the image feels slightly crooked.</td>', 'Love the high-key nature of this image, the blown-out background, the ''framing,'' and his pose. The image might have been stronger if he had been off to the right side of the window frame (with more to look out into) and if the model had extended his neck slightly for more length/tension. Also, the image feels slightly crooked.', '2010-04-27 17:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974764, 869042, 116499, '<td valign="top">Love the focus and the angle. The trash can behind his calf is distracting; watch the background! The contrast in this image great.</td>', 'Love the focus and the angle. The trash can behind his calf is distracting; watch the background! The contrast in this image great.', '2010-04-27 17:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974767, 871368, 116499, '<td valign="top">The model is a little stiff, but I like the background and her styling.</td>', 'The model is a little stiff, but I like the background and her styling.', '2010-04-27 17:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974775, 871311, 116499, '<td valign="top">The model is well-styled and well-positioned aside from her right-arm (if she''d grabbed the edge of the truck that would have brought a lot more interesting tension); the image is composed well, too. That said, the environment is distracting. She either needs to pop more (with post-editing) or you should have at least removed the cones from the shot.</td>', 'The model is well-styled and well-positioned aside from her right-arm (if she''d grabbed the edge of the truck that would have brought a lot more interesting tension); the image is composed well, too. That said, the environment is distracting. She either needs to pop more (with post-editing) or you should have at least removed the cones from the shot.', '2010-04-27 17:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974789, 871298, 39349, '<td valign="top">BFC: Beautiful post work. Lovely model.</td>', 'BFC: Beautiful post work. Lovely model.', '2010-04-27 17:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974798, 870904, 116499, '<td valign="top">This is great from about hips up. I love her face and the arch of her back. The dress is gorgeous as is her hair/makeup. I love the lighting. The problem with the image is the position of her legs and how that makes the dress pull around her knees. It also seems to detract from her overall presence in the image, which from the hips up is very stark. To me this image is about the dress and her face, but the shoes/legs distract me. If she were turned just slightly more toward the camera, this would be really great: she''d also fill up more of the image on the left, which would strengthen the image as well.</td>', 'This is great from about hips up. I love her face and the arch of her back. The dress is gorgeous as is her hair/makeup. I love the lighting. The problem with the image is the position of her legs and how that makes the dress pull around her knees. It also seems to detract from her overall presence in the image, which from the hips up is very stark. To me this image is about the dress and her face, but the shoes/legs distract me. If she were turned just slightly more toward the camera, this would be really great: she''d also fill up more of the image on the left, which would strengthen the image as well.', '2010-04-27 17:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974803, 871112, 116499, '<td valign="top">She connects well with the camera. Her feet look strange: I love that she''s holding her shoes, but it would have been better if she not taken such a wide stance and if she had been on her tip-toes to give her some more tension in her body. Great lighting and really good full-length shot.</td>', 'She connects well with the camera. Her feet look strange: I love that she''s holding her shoes, but it would have been better if she not taken such a wide stance and if she had been on her tip-toes to give her some more tension in her body. Great lighting and really good full-length shot.', '2010-04-27 17:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974847, 870347, 108982, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this picture.  Love the blue to black color transition, it expresses emotion and motion.  Really well put together imho</td>', 'Absolutely love this picture.  Love the blue to black color transition, it expresses emotion and motion.  Really well put together imho', '2010-04-27 17:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974854, 869693, 108982, '<td valign="top">Great picture, IMHO the only distraction are some small harsh shadows near the vase and from the piano lid.  Great colors.  Great model.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Great picture, IMHO the only distraction are some small harsh shadows near the vase and from the piano lid.  Great colors.  Great model.  Beautiful.', '2010-04-27 17:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974856, 868020, 108982, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors, nice emotion lighting and pensive expression work well together.  Nice rich tones in the chase and dress really smartly composed</td>', 'beautiful colors, nice emotion lighting and pensive expression work well together.  Nice rich tones in the chase and dress really smartly composed', '2010-04-27 18:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974862, 870539, 108982, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  I never give points for cute but OMG how could you not.  adorable kid, what an expression.  Love that you gave it an overcast feel even though it wasobviously a nice day.</td>', 'Very cute.  I never give points for cute but OMG how could you not.  adorable kid, what an expression.  Love that you gave it an overcast feel even though it wasobviously a nice day.', '2010-04-27 18:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974864, 870228, 108982, '<td valign="top">Having fun and capturing a great moment is always special.  kooky idea that works really well.  nice job</td>', 'Having fun and capturing a great moment is always special.  kooky idea that works really well.  nice job', '2010-04-27 18:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974868, 871579, 108982, '<td valign="top">Nice back lighting and good job blowing out the backdrop with out losing the pale subject.  smart use of rich colors top to bottom to control the composition. nice</td>', 'Nice back lighting and good job blowing out the backdrop with out losing the pale subject.  smart use of rich colors top to bottom to control the composition. nice', '2010-04-27 18:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974876, 869992, 108982, '<td valign="top">Nice street style lighting.  great model.  nice use of shadow and light</td>', 'Nice street style lighting.  great model.  nice use of shadow and light', '2010-04-27 18:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974878, 871181, 108982, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2010-04-27 18:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974881, 870195, 108982, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2010-04-27 18:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974885, 871568, 108982, '<td valign="top">nice basic shot. simple but works</td>', 'nice basic shot. simple but works', '2010-04-27 18:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974941, 869042, 103150, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2010-04-27 18:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974943, 869615, 103150, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t look to happy to be doing this</td>', 'She doesn''t look to happy to be doing this', '2010-04-27 18:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974944, 870347, 103150, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2010-04-27 18:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974947, 871364, 103150, '<td valign="top">her face looks a little out of focus</td>', 'her face looks a little out of focus', '2010-04-27 18:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974951, 870605, 103150, '<td valign="top">Is her face out of focus?</td>', 'Is her face out of focus?', '2010-04-27 18:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974954, 869080, 103150, '<td valign="top">Her face looks out of focus.</td>', 'Her face looks out of focus.', '2010-04-27 18:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974955, 871047, 103150, '<td valign="top">her face is out of focus</td>', 'her face is out of focus', '2010-04-27 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974956, 871369, 103150, '<td valign="top">her face is out of focus</td>', 'her face is out of focus', '2010-04-27 18:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5974958, 871568, 103150, '<td valign="top">nice angle</td>', 'nice angle', '2010-04-27 18:56:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5975524, 869971, 61084, '<td valign="top">Pretty lady. Where is the studio? DNMC.</td>', 'Pretty lady. Where is the studio? DNMC.', '2010-04-27 23:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5975537, 871187, 61084, '<td valign="top">Supposed to be a studio shot. Sorry, but this is not and DNMC.</td>', 'Supposed to be a studio shot. Sorry, but this is not and DNMC.', '2010-04-27 23:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5975540, 871382, 61084, '<td valign="top">Awfully big studio you have there. DNMC.</td>', 'Awfully big studio you have there. DNMC.', '2010-04-27 23:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5975543, 870070, 61084, '<td valign="top">Not a studio shot. DNMC.</td>', 'Not a studio shot. DNMC.', '2010-04-27 23:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5975567, 870539, 10268, '<td valign="top">Seems both a little soft, and a little on the dark side.  I do really like the depth of field, and the colors.  Nice pose as well.</td>', 'Seems both a little soft, and a little on the dark side.  I do really like the depth of field, and the colors.  Nice pose as well.', '2010-04-27 23:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5975571, 871430, 90626, '<td valign="top">I think a smile or some expression would have been nice. I do like the light color scheme.</td>', 'I think a smile or some expression would have been nice. I do like the light color scheme.', '2010-04-27 23:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5975577, 871368, 10268, '<td valign="top">She''s very pretty, and I like the location and the wardrobe, but the lighting is a little flat.  6.</td>', 'She''s very pretty, and I like the location and the wardrobe, but the lighting is a little flat.  6.', '2010-04-27 23:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5975578, 871073, 10268, '<td valign="top">No, sorry.  She kind of looks like a 40 year old drug addict with those clothes, the harsh lighting, and the pose.</td>', 'No, sorry.  She kind of looks like a 40 year old drug addict with those clothes, the harsh lighting, and the pose.', '2010-04-27 23:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5975598, 870004, 90626, '<td valign="top">love the colors!!</td>', 'love the colors!!', '2010-04-27 23:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
