(5975994, 871362, 91783, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot!!! i dont know how this got scored so low! I love this and like everything is wonderfully done. Im still shocked...<br/> <br/>Although i do see their (commenters) point about not being full length... if only this was in the free study. (i gave this a 9 anyways.)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-04-28 00:21:42.</i></td>', 'This is a fantastic shot!!! i dont know how this got scored so low! I love this and like everything is wonderfully done. Im still shocked... Although i do see their (commenters) point about not being full length... if only this was in the free study. (i gave this a 9 anyways.)', '2010-04-28 01:20:22.000000', '2010-04-28 01:21:42.000000', 0),
