(5978818, 871334, 63269, '<td valign="top">Haha this is great! It must''ve taken you forever to get it all set up. I think I agree with the other commenters that a more straight-on angle would have been nicer. Personally, I would have liked to see a regular background used... with the newspaper as background, the whole thing just feels way too cluttered to me. Either that or perhaps a little depth of field - to make the background blurry - might have helped out. But really awesome idea and great work! :D</td>', 'Haha this is great! It must''ve taken you forever to get it all set up. I think I agree with the other commenters that a more straight-on angle would have been nicer. Personally, I would have liked to see a regular background used... with the newspaper as background, the whole thing just feels way too cluttered to me. Either that or perhaps a little depth of field - to make the background blurry - might have helped out. But really awesome idea and great work! :D', '2010-04-29 08:57:20.000000', NULL, 0),
